        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "admonition",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "The name provided with the annotation is resolved as a bean name by the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " of which the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "CommonAnnotationBeanPostProcessor"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " is aware. The names can be resolved through JNDI if you configure Spring’s "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "SimpleJndiBeanFactory"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              }
            ],
            "kind": "link",
            "target": "https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/6.2.0/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jndi/support/SimpleJndiBeanFactory.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " explicitly. However, we recommend that you rely on the default behavior and use Spring’s JNDI lookup capabilities to preserve the level of indirection."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null,
        "type": "note"
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "In the exclusive case of "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Resource"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " usage with no explicit name specified, and similar to "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Autowired"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "@Resource"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " finds a primary type match instead of a specific named bean and resolves well known resolvable dependencies: the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "BeanFactory"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ApplicationContext"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ResourceLoader"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "ApplicationEventPublisher"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ", and "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "MessageSource"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " interfaces."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Thus, in the following example, the "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "customerPreferenceDao"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " field first looks for a bean named \"customerPreferenceDao\" and then falls back to a primary type match for the type "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "CustomerPreferenceDao"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": ":"
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "dlist",
                "id": null,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "description": {
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "context": "listing",
                          "id": null,
                          "inlines": [
                            {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "value": "public class MovieRecommender {\n\n\t@Resource\n\tprivate CustomerPreferenceDao customerPreferenceDao;\n\n\t@Resource\n\tprivate ApplicationContext context; "
                            },
                            {
                              "guard": "// ",
                              "icons": null,
                              "id": "CO3-1",
                              "kind": "callout",
                              "number": "1",
                              "src": "",
                              "xml": false
                            },
                            {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "value": "\n\n\tpublic MovieRecommender() {\n\t}\n\n\t// ...\n}"
                            }
                          ],
                          "language": "java",
                          "roles": [],
                          "title": null
                        },
                        {
                          "context": "colist",
                          "id": null,
                          "items": [
                            {
                              "blocks": [],
